  "releaseNotes": "- BREAKING CHANGE: The `DSInternals.Win32.WebAuthn.Entra` namespace (the `MicrosoftGraphWebauthnCredentialCreationOptions`, `MicrosoftGraphWebauthnAttestationResponse`, and `MicrosoftGraphAttestationPublicKeyCredential` classes) has been removed. Microsoft Graph payloads are now represented by the data model classes from the Microsoft Graph SDK.\n- BREAKING CHANGE: The synchronous `LoadFromFile` methods of the `BitwardenCleartextVaultExport`, `BitwardenEncryptedVaultExport`, `CredentialExchangeFile`, and `KeePassXCPasskey` classes have been replaced by asynchronous `LoadFromFileAsync` methods, which stream-deserialize the JSON files and support cancellation.\n- Added the `BitwardenVaultExportHeader` class for detecting whether a Bitwarden vault export is encrypted and/or password-protected without parsing the entire file.\n- The `WindowsHelloForBusinessSigner.ListCngKeys` method now accepts an optional `machineKeys` parameter to enumerate machine keys instead of user keys.",
